    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n86635" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προαπο-δίδωμι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>pay in advance,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PTeb.
				296.13
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>give an account of first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				7.46
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.D.
				<u>Adv.</u>
				195.17
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὴν βάσιν</span>
			<i>finish</i> the rhythmical conclusion of a sentence
			<i>before</i> the speaker reaches it, <i><span class="en">
				Longin.
				41.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b> of the
			bowels, <i>act first,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aët.
				7.39
			</span></i>.</div>
